{
  "name": "Track LLM prices and balance with Straitly, Slack and data tables",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n001-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Track LLM prices and balance with Straitly, Slack and data tables\n\nKeep an eye on your Straitly wallet and on model prices without opening the dashboard. Every morning this workflow checks your balance and warns in Slack when it drops below your limit. It also compares today's model prices with yesterday's snapshot in an n8n data table and posts new models and price changes.\n\n### How it works\n1. A daily schedule loads your settings.\n2. Straitly returns the wallet balance. Below the limit, Slack gets a warning.\n3. Straitly returns the model catalog with prices, which is compared with the saved snapshot.\n4. New models and changed prices are posted to Slack in one message.\n5. The snapshot is updated for the next run.\n\n### Setup steps\n- [ ] Install the community node **n8n-nodes-straitly** (Settings > Community nodes)\n- [ ] Add your Straitly API key (straitly.ai) as a credential\n- [ ] Create a data table with columns model_id, input_price, output_price, checked_at and put its ID in **Settings**\n- [ ] Set **min_balance_usd** and your Slack channel in **Settings**\n\n### Customization\nWatch only some models with a filter, change the schedule, or send alerts to email.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 720
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n002-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "1. Check the balance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Check the balance\n\nEvery morning the wallet balance is read from Straitly and Slack is warned when it is below your limit.",
        "width": 1360,
        "height": 370,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n008-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "2. Compare prices",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2020,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Compare prices\n\nToday's model prices are compared with the snapshot saved in the data table on the last run.",
        "width": 840,
        "height": 570,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n013-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "3. Report and save",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2900,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Report and save\n\nNew models and price changes are merged into one Slack message, then the snapshot is updated.",
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 370,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n003-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "position": [
        680,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n004-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "Settings-0",
              "name": "min_balance_usd",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 5
            },
            {
              "id": "Settings-1",
              "name": "data_table_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "YOUR_DATA_TABLE_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "Settings-2",
              "name": "slack_channel",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "#llm-costs"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        940,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n005-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Get balance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-straitly.straitly",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "account",
        "operation": "getBalance"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "straitlyApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Straitly account"
        }
      },
      "position": [
        1200,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n006-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Low balance?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.available_usd }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.min_balance_usd }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        1460,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n007-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Warn low balance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.slack_channel }}"
        },
        "text": "=:warning: Straitly balance is ${{ $json.available_usd.toFixed(2) }}, below your ${{ $('Settings').first().json.min_balance_usd }} limit. Top up: {{ $json.add_credits_url }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      },
      "position": [
        1720,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n009-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Get models",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-straitly.straitly",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "model",
        "operation": "getMany",
        "returnAll": true,
        "simplify": true,
        "filters": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "straitlyApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Straitly account"
        }
      },
      "position": [
        2080,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n010-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Price fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "Price fields-0",
              "name": "model_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "Price fields-1",
              "name": "input_price",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.input_price_usd_per_million }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "Price fields-2",
              "name": "output_price",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.output_price_usd_per_million }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        2340,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n011-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Compare with snapshot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.compareDatasets",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "parameters": {
        "mergeByFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "field1": "model_id",
              "field2": "model_id"
            }
          ]
        },
        "resolve": "preferInput1",
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        2600,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n012-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Read snapshot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "parameters": {
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.data_table_id }}"
        },
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "get",
        "returnAll": true
      },
      "executeOnce": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "position": [
        2080,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n014-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "New and changed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "parameters": {},
      "position": [
        2960,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n015-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Save snapshot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "parameters": {
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.data_table_id }}"
        },
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "model_id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.model_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "model_id": "={{ $json.model_id }}",
            "input_price": "={{ $json.input_price }}",
            "output_price": "={{ $json.output_price }}",
            "checked_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        3220,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n016-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Collect changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "destinationFieldName": "changes",
        "options": {}
      },
      "executeOnce": false,
      "position": [
        3480,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n017-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Post price changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.slack_channel }}"
        },
        "text": "=:moneybag: {{ $json.changes.length }} new or changed model price(s) on Straitly (USD per 1M tokens, input / output):\n{{ $json.changes.slice(0, 20).map(c => '• ' + c.model_id + ': ' + c.input_price + ' / ' + c.output_price).join('\\n') }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      },
      "position": [
        3740,
        180
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
